  "details": "VRChat has recently been adding more features that are locked behind VRC+, yet also have world compatibility. While I understand the need to monetize VRChat features, it's kind of difficult to make features for, say, drone flying or racing. Or 3rd person map adjustments. Or gifting related events.\n\nI don't really want to spend the money just for debugging right now, especially for features I don't make a profit on. But I also don't want my map to go without consideration for users who do want to use drones, preventing cheating, check whether UI breaks, etc.",
